  "explanation": "The original sources D1S2 and D1S8 confirm that Giovanni Evangelista Tornefranza is currently the Governor of Jamaica, appointed by the British monarchy. Document D2S2 and other sections of document 2 establish that he formerly held the position of diocesan bishop, actively involved in pastoral care and governance of the Diocese of Fano. The term 'diocesan bishop' is explicitly used in D2S2 and supported by multiple contextual references. The proposed candidate 'Bishop of Fano' (C2) is not directly stated in the original sources and is thus not included."
